Hi,

The P2600/TCG/PWG meeting will take place on Monday to Friday
3-7 April 2006, with the PWG Plenary on Thursday morning, in
Mt. Laurel, NJ.

The OSDL Printing Summit will take place the _following_ week
on Monday to Wednesday 10-12 April 2006, in Atlanta, GA.

The PWG would welcome the participation of FSG Open Printing
in a joint plenary on Thursday 6 April.

Please consider your travel plans and notify Norm Jacobs (for=20
FSG/OP) and Ira McDonald (for PWG).

Many thanks,
- Ira


